  {
   "text": "Tesla's Robotaxi Safety Report lists Austin, Dallas, Fort Worth, Houston, Miami, Orlando, San Antonio and Tampa as operating, and Las Vegas, Jacksonville and Phoenix as coming soon. Musk statements are not counted as announcements here.",
